  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Davivienda: Credit Facility for SMEs, Women-Led SMEs, and Green Financing in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The financing consists of a loan of up to US$70 million (the &#x201c;Project&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Financing&#x201d;) from IDBInvest to Banco Davivienda Salvadore&#xf1;o, S.A. (&#x201c;Davivienda&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Bank&#x201d;), with a term of up toeight years. The Financing may be supplemented by one or more participants with an additional amount of approximately US$50 million.The Financing will be used to support the Small and Medium&#x2011;Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;SMEs&#x201d;) segments, SMEs led by women (&#x201c;Women-Led SMEs&#x201d;), and green financing in ElSalvador. The Project may be accompanied by technical assistance in areas such as digitalization and innovation.</narrative>
  </description>
